### ti-ai-question-ui — manual API testing directly against ti-document-agent
### Requires ti-document-agent running standalone on :8087 (see README "Run as a standalone
### microservice"). Paths here are unprefixed — as seen by the service itself, without the
### gateway's leading "/document-agent" segment.

@agent = http://localhost:8087

### List uploaded documents
GET {{agent}}/rest/v1/documents
Accept: application/json

###

### Generate questions from a document (replace 101 with a real document id from the list above)
POST {{agent}}/rest/v1/documents/101/question-generation
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "userMessage": "Generate questions about the compliance obligations described in this document.",
  "requestedQuestionCount": 3
}

###

### Health check
GET {{agent}}/rest/v1/version
Accept: text/plain

###
